  "worked_solution": "Computing the inner product according to the definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u27e8x(t),y(t)\u27e9 & =x(-2)y(-2)+x(-1)y(-1)+x(0)y(0). \\\\  & =0\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot (-2)+2\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =0+0-2 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
